WEBVTT

01:45.709 --> 01:52.007
Good morning, Night City! Rise and shine
for a new day in the City of Dreams…

01:52.591 --> 01:54.552
Got reports of a pile-up
on the Heywood highway.

01:54.635 --> 01:58.389
We've got gonks dreaming of
becoming the next Weyland Boa Boa

01:58.472 --> 02:01.392
jamming up traffic for the rest of us!

02:02.059 --> 02:07.606
…gangoons swarming like flies! What is it
about this City that keeps attracting…

02:09.024 --> 02:10.776
Never fear the risk!

02:10.860 --> 02:15.990
You'll never make it big
dreaming quiet, dreaming small.

02:17.324 --> 02:22.830
Wanna know where
all the legends of Night City play?

02:24.415 --> 02:25.249
It's…

02:25.332 --> 02:26.167
Maine.

02:27.168 --> 02:29.670
When's the last time you ate?

02:36.135 --> 02:40.347
You're shaking. All that chrome's
messing with your nerves.

02:40.431 --> 02:44.310
When this's over, you gotta refit.
Go lightspec, reduce your load.

02:44.393 --> 02:47.563
Just some jitters.
Don't make it a big deal.

02:48.772 --> 02:50.399
Shit, at this rate…

02:51.442 --> 02:53.652
A lil' metal ain't gonna…

02:55.362 --> 02:56.572
Maine?

02:57.489 --> 02:58.991
Hey! Maine!

02:59.074 --> 03:02.578
Fuck off!
No one's gonna set my limits but me!

03:02.661 --> 03:05.581
I made it this far without any trouble.

03:05.664 --> 03:07.958
I ain't gonna turn back now!

03:08.042 --> 03:09.460
Where's the fucking data?!

03:09.543 --> 03:11.962
You know Kiwi's diving for it!

03:17.217 --> 03:20.054
ICE is thicker than I expected…

03:33.442 --> 03:36.403
Maine! Stop! What're you…

03:36.487 --> 03:37.321
Hey!

03:41.867 --> 03:44.536
Kiwi? Falco?

03:46.413 --> 03:48.332
You back with us? Shit…

03:48.958 --> 03:49.833
Dorio?

03:50.334 --> 03:53.712
What gives? We get jumped?

03:54.797 --> 03:56.131
What happened to Kiwi…

03:58.926 --> 04:02.137
…forecast for heavy rainfall on the coast.

04:02.221 --> 04:04.723
Districts like Santo Domingo
and Westbrook,

04:04.807 --> 04:10.271
are bound to see showers
from midnight to sunrise--

04:13.232 --> 04:15.734
What the fuck, Falco?!

04:16.777 --> 04:19.738
Ask Maine? Just tell me…

04:19.822 --> 04:21.156
Yo!

04:21.240 --> 04:22.449
Huh…?

04:27.621 --> 04:29.540
I won't do it.

04:30.165 --> 04:32.751
How'd Kiwi land on an op table?

04:32.835 --> 04:34.878
She was on Tanaka's case, right?

04:34.962 --> 04:36.422
What went wrong?

04:36.505 --> 04:38.173
Ask the gonk next to me.

04:38.257 --> 04:39.174
Fuck off.

04:40.426 --> 04:44.513
Maine punched her out. Lost his cool when
she ran into some ICE that snagged her…

04:44.596 --> 04:45.431
What!?

04:45.514 --> 04:47.558
Maine. How about you
get your head checked?

04:48.392 --> 04:51.061
Maine, next time you start losing it--

04:56.233 --> 04:57.067
Hey…

04:57.651 --> 04:59.069
"Losing it"…?

04:59.653 --> 05:01.071
Cyberpsychosis.

05:10.664 --> 05:11.707
Maine!

05:12.624 --> 05:14.335
Uh… Hey.

05:14.418 --> 05:17.463
Dorio just told me. You…

05:18.047 --> 05:20.549
You'll be fine, right?
You won't end up like…

05:20.632 --> 05:21.675
Fine?

05:22.384 --> 05:25.262
What you mean by "fine"? Kid.

05:25.888 --> 05:27.598
You asking if I'm going psycho?

05:28.932 --> 05:31.226
You think I'm losing it?

05:31.310 --> 05:32.603
Maine, I didn't say…

05:33.187 --> 05:34.772
Lay off, kid.

05:35.397 --> 05:38.317
Your snooping around's
getting on my nerves.

05:41.070 --> 05:45.991
You think you're hot shit
'cause you're faster than me?

05:46.575 --> 05:48.744
That Sandy was supposed to be mine.

05:54.249 --> 05:56.502
I made it this far.

05:56.585 --> 06:01.006
Ain't no way I'm gonna downgrade now…

06:02.132 --> 06:04.635
Can't stop running now…

06:05.677 --> 06:08.388
The pigs probably have our trail already.

06:08.472 --> 06:10.891
We only got 'til morning, if that.

06:10.974 --> 06:12.017
Are you hearing me?

06:12.101 --> 06:13.268
I said no!

06:13.352 --> 06:15.771
You're the one that's not listening!

06:15.854 --> 06:17.815
He's Arasaka…

06:20.442 --> 06:22.277
Let's call it off.

06:22.361 --> 06:24.488
C'mon, Lucy.

06:24.571 --> 06:26.156
You don't gotta do it.

06:26.240 --> 06:27.574
Shut it, David!

06:27.658 --> 06:31.328
We can drop Tanaka where we took him.
Pretend none of this happened.

06:31.411 --> 06:33.288
You've got a lot of nerve!

06:33.831 --> 06:35.207
I'm not done with you!

06:36.542 --> 06:39.086
David… Tell me I can do it.

06:39.169 --> 06:40.796
Wha… I thought…

06:40.879 --> 06:42.005
Tell me!

06:43.090 --> 06:46.510
You don't understand
what Arasaka's like at all.

06:46.593 --> 06:50.973
They're always watching us. You… me…

06:51.056 --> 06:52.850
We can't just call it off.

06:53.433 --> 06:54.935
We don't have a choice.

06:55.477 --> 06:57.020
I know that.

06:58.230 --> 07:00.816
But… I need you to tell me that I can.

07:01.483 --> 07:02.818
Please…

07:05.737 --> 07:08.532
I'm sorry, Lucy. I…

07:10.159 --> 07:12.244
I know you can do this.

07:12.327 --> 07:15.330
I believe in you, Lucy.

07:17.291 --> 07:18.459
I'll do it.

07:18.542 --> 07:19.585
What?

07:19.668 --> 07:23.714
But David's coming, too.
And kick Maine out.

07:23.797 --> 07:25.424
Those are my conditions.

07:29.052 --> 07:30.262
Fine.

07:30.345 --> 07:34.099
But you'll keep us in the loop.
Pings every quarter hour.

07:34.183 --> 07:36.810
You've got until daybreak.
Don't screw this up!

07:38.228 --> 07:40.647
David! Where's Maine?

07:42.691 --> 07:44.401
Hell if I know!

07:52.659 --> 07:53.494
Maine!

07:58.373 --> 07:59.374
Dorio…

08:00.626 --> 08:03.629
Hey, you sure we don't need
Dorio for backup?

08:03.712 --> 08:05.214
Grow a spine.

08:05.297 --> 08:06.340
Why didn't you…

08:08.300 --> 08:09.801
You should've told me.

08:09.885 --> 08:12.179
Why's it gotta be just the two of us?

08:12.262 --> 08:13.305
David.

08:21.980 --> 08:23.982
H-Hey…

08:26.151 --> 08:30.239
Why were you hiding your deep-dive port?

08:35.160 --> 08:36.411
Jacking in now…

08:40.207 --> 08:41.500
David…

08:41.583 --> 08:42.668
Yeah?

08:45.087 --> 08:46.255
I'm going in.

08:50.050 --> 08:54.638
Where there's a trap,
there has to be an entryway.

09:19.788 --> 09:21.248
We gonna kill him?

09:22.958 --> 09:25.085
We need a plan
in case she doesn't make it.

09:26.211 --> 09:30.090
Wouldn't have needed one
if you weren't feeling like shit.

09:53.322 --> 09:56.450
You're willing to bet everything
on a backup runner?

09:56.533 --> 09:57.868
Absolutely.

09:57.951 --> 09:59.286
Tick tock, Maine.

09:59.369 --> 10:02.497
Arasaka is still short one executive.

10:02.581 --> 10:04.791
I trust you understand
there's no room for error.

10:04.875 --> 10:05.959
Made that clear.

10:07.794 --> 10:09.004
What?!

10:09.921 --> 10:11.673
The fuck you staring at, Faraday?

10:20.766 --> 10:22.184
A glitch…?

10:23.060 --> 10:25.187
Damn it… Now of all times!

10:29.149 --> 10:30.484
W-Wait…

10:30.567 --> 10:31.568
Wait, please!

10:31.652 --> 10:32.903
David!

10:36.782 --> 10:38.825
Maine! Snap out of it!

10:38.909 --> 10:40.077
Hey!

10:40.744 --> 10:43.372
Damn it! Why is he waking up?!

10:44.122 --> 10:45.791
What are you doing, David?!

10:51.338 --> 10:54.549
I knew it… You're David…

10:55.550 --> 10:56.677
How do you…

10:57.719 --> 11:00.931
I've heard much about you.

11:01.014 --> 11:05.268
Your incident with my son at the Academy…

11:06.937 --> 11:11.316
And despite that, I ordered
your readmittance to the Academy.

11:11.400 --> 11:12.609
You?

11:12.693 --> 11:16.029
Please, David. You can stop this.

11:16.947 --> 11:19.616
I don't want to die.

11:19.699 --> 11:21.868
We just need the data. You won't…

11:21.952 --> 11:23.745
Don't be so naive!

11:25.163 --> 11:26.873
I've seen their faces!

11:26.957 --> 11:29.626
Do you believe Arasaka
won't hunt them down?

11:30.544 --> 11:35.006
Listen to me.
Why do you think I lifted your expulsion?

11:35.090 --> 11:38.427
You have exceptional abilities.

11:38.510 --> 11:41.638
I believe you could become
a valuable asset to Arasaka!

11:42.305 --> 11:45.892
We could give you a great future, David!

11:45.976 --> 11:48.019
Do not throw your life to waste!

11:58.864 --> 11:59.781
This is it.

12:11.251 --> 12:13.420
I can't let you go.

12:13.503 --> 12:15.589
Then get in contact with Arasaka.

12:15.672 --> 12:19.217
It will all be over
in less than five minutes.

12:19.301 --> 12:20.927
That ain't what I mean!

12:21.011 --> 12:22.304
I can't betray my crew.

12:22.387 --> 12:26.308
Stupid boy.
Don't you see you're being used?

12:26.391 --> 12:28.810
And Arasaka won't?

12:28.894 --> 12:31.104
No. You are blind.

12:31.188 --> 12:34.691
Who do you think is paying for this stunt?

12:34.774 --> 12:38.570
It has Militech written all over it.
All roads lead back to the corporations.

12:38.653 --> 12:41.406
Regardless of
how high you climb in this world,

12:41.490 --> 12:44.618
you will never amount to the lowest corpo.

12:44.701 --> 12:46.077
That's not…

13:05.639 --> 13:06.473
David?

13:07.599 --> 13:10.769
David… What…

13:10.852 --> 13:13.813
What is it that you want?

13:15.524 --> 13:17.359
What do I want…?

13:19.778 --> 13:21.196
David! What the fuck?!

13:21.279 --> 13:22.113
He's awake!

13:22.197 --> 13:24.991
Where's his tranq… Hand it over!

13:26.826 --> 13:28.745
Fuck! What just happened?!

13:29.329 --> 13:32.123
Shit! It's all over if he flatlines!

13:32.207 --> 13:33.041
David!

13:33.124 --> 13:37.170
Snap out of it, David!
You got her in, right?!

13:37.254 --> 13:38.380
Now get her out!

13:38.964 --> 13:41.258
Dorio! Lucy's still stuck in deep-dive!

13:41.341 --> 13:44.010
-What?!
-Hurry! Disconnect her!

13:46.096 --> 13:47.764
Alright! Pull her out!

14:01.236 --> 14:02.612
The data?

14:02.696 --> 14:05.782
Jabbed him right after
his heart stopped… so probably good.

14:06.616 --> 14:07.993
David!

14:08.076 --> 14:10.120
Yeah, Lucy's--

14:12.330 --> 14:15.375
David! What the fuck were you doing?

14:16.209 --> 14:17.877
What about you?

14:17.961 --> 14:20.380
What the fuck were you doing?

14:20.463 --> 14:21.881
What did you say?

14:21.965 --> 14:25.760
Knocking Kiwi out…
Dropping all this on Lucy's lap.

14:25.844 --> 14:28.096
What the fuck's been up with you?!

14:28.179 --> 14:29.890
Kid, don't start…

14:29.973 --> 14:31.391
Maine! David!

14:32.058 --> 14:36.605
Jammer got fried when Tanaka flatlined!
Trauma Team caught the signal!

14:36.688 --> 14:37.898
Motherfuck!

14:40.358 --> 14:42.485
David, we ain't done yet!

14:42.569 --> 14:44.529
But prep our wheels, quick!

14:46.072 --> 14:47.741
Get it together, David!

14:47.824 --> 14:50.368
You volunteered for this, so do it!

14:51.745 --> 14:53.747
Wait in the ride. We'll catch up.

14:53.830 --> 14:54.998
I know!

14:57.334 --> 14:59.586
Fucking Platinum premium plan service…

14:59.669 --> 15:00.629
Dorio!

15:05.383 --> 15:08.428
Registering gunfire in the service area.

15:08.511 --> 15:13.600
Possible hostiles present.
Requesting NCPD backup in force.

15:24.402 --> 15:25.946
David?

15:26.029 --> 15:27.697
Lucy! You alright?

15:28.281 --> 15:30.450
What's going on?

15:30.533 --> 15:34.412
Tanaka woke up, but his brain
suddenly fried for some reason.

15:35.789 --> 15:37.791
Did something happen in there?

15:37.874 --> 15:39.626
Where's Maine and Dorio?

15:39.709 --> 15:41.836
They're bringing Tanaka's body…

15:42.379 --> 15:43.338
But he's dead.

15:43.421 --> 15:45.006
We saved him.

15:45.548 --> 15:46.675
Why?!

15:46.758 --> 15:49.135
What do you mean? We still need the data.

15:49.219 --> 15:51.221
There's no point bringing him.

15:52.222 --> 15:53.890
There was no data.

15:55.725 --> 15:57.227
No way…

15:57.811 --> 16:00.814
Fuck. We're definitely on
'Saka's radar now.

16:00.897 --> 16:03.858
Maine! Don't forget to take your meds!

16:04.442 --> 16:05.652
Just took a shot!

16:05.735 --> 16:06.569
Don't move!

16:14.703 --> 16:19.624
Fuck! Why's NCPD always fast
when it comes to us?

16:19.708 --> 16:21.626
Back up! Go to the back!

16:23.211 --> 16:25.380
Fuck! They won't pick up!

16:26.214 --> 16:27.132
David!

16:27.215 --> 16:28.425
Where are you going?

16:28.508 --> 16:29.342
Gonna go help.

16:29.426 --> 16:32.012
No! What if they slip out another way?

16:32.095 --> 16:33.263
We're waiting!

16:41.688 --> 16:42.647
I'm going.

16:42.731 --> 16:43.648
David!

16:43.732 --> 16:47.110
What are you so afraid of?!
It shouldn't be taking 'em this long!

16:47.193 --> 16:48.028
Wait!

16:48.111 --> 16:53.033
I got a signal. Trauma is here…
alongside the NCPD.

16:53.700 --> 16:55.035
They're surrounded.

16:55.118 --> 16:56.119
Then we gotta help.

16:56.202 --> 16:58.288
No! Do you want to die?!

17:06.379 --> 17:09.257
I won't die. I'll come back to you.

17:09.340 --> 17:10.633
David…

17:10.717 --> 17:15.096
They might not make it.
We should cut our losses and run.

17:15.180 --> 17:18.308
We can still hear them fighting!
They're still alive!

17:19.768 --> 17:21.728
You're acting weird today, Lucy.

17:22.604 --> 17:25.565
You saw something, didn't you?
In Tanaka's neural net…

17:25.648 --> 17:28.443
I… only wanted to…

17:30.070 --> 17:31.529
Lucy?

17:31.613 --> 17:33.615
Aren't you gonna tell me

17:34.407 --> 17:36.242
that you believe in me, too?

17:56.304 --> 17:57.222
The fuck, Maine?!

17:57.806 --> 17:58.890
Get it together…

18:04.562 --> 18:06.731
Shit! Fucking gonk…

18:12.362 --> 18:13.363
Don't shoot!

18:13.446 --> 18:14.364
Why not?!

18:14.447 --> 18:16.324
He's holding a platinum client hostage!

18:16.407 --> 18:17.242
Not our problem!

18:45.812 --> 18:46.855
Dorio…

18:46.938 --> 18:50.108
Maine… Hold on, I'm on my way.

18:51.401 --> 18:52.527
I need…

18:53.444 --> 18:55.613
I need you to tell me I can do this.

19:07.375 --> 19:08.626
Was this…

19:09.210 --> 19:10.837
Was this my fault?

19:18.803 --> 19:22.640
Freeze! Weapons down,
hands behind your head!

19:23.266 --> 19:24.642
Last warning!

19:33.735 --> 19:36.029
Platinum client confirmed dead.

19:36.112 --> 19:36.988
Hey.

19:38.239 --> 19:39.407
Is this my fault?

19:42.160 --> 19:43.161
It's cyberpsychosis!

19:43.244 --> 19:44.913
Flag MaxTac now…

19:44.996 --> 19:46.164
Got a cyberpsy--

19:49.250 --> 19:51.461
Client has flatlined. Evacuate!

19:51.544 --> 19:53.046
Hey, where are you going?!

19:53.129 --> 19:55.590
Client policy's void!
This's your problem now!

19:55.673 --> 19:56.549
Fuck that!

19:57.342 --> 19:59.344
He's here! Get us out!

20:18.154 --> 20:19.072
Shit!

20:29.249 --> 20:31.125
David… Can you hear me?

20:31.209 --> 20:33.127
Maine's gone psycho.

20:33.711 --> 20:37.507
They've called in MaxTac.
Turn around, come back…

20:38.800 --> 20:40.009
Maine…

20:41.094 --> 20:43.263
Oh. Hey, kid.

20:43.346 --> 20:45.139
You alright?

20:45.223 --> 20:47.642
Maine, I came to back you up…

20:48.226 --> 20:49.060
Uh…

20:49.143 --> 20:51.854
Dorio's dead.

20:52.438 --> 20:53.273
What?

20:54.482 --> 20:56.526
What are you doing…?

20:56.609 --> 20:59.028
Last thing I can do for her.

21:01.114 --> 21:02.615
Let's run, Maine.

21:02.699 --> 21:04.158
You're gonna die.

21:05.952 --> 21:10.164
No more running. Reaper's calling my name.

21:11.082 --> 21:12.667
What are you saying?

21:17.297 --> 21:19.882
Fine. I'll fight too.

21:19.966 --> 21:21.384
Kid…

21:21.467 --> 21:25.555
I've already made up my mind.
I'll do it! I'll save you.

21:27.307 --> 21:29.809
Damn it! Stop shaking!

21:29.892 --> 21:33.771
Fuck you, MaxTac! Come and get us!

21:33.855 --> 21:36.524
Maine, we can get through this together.

21:36.607 --> 21:40.570
We'll get through this. And then… then…

22:01.507 --> 22:02.842
David.

22:05.887 --> 22:07.847
You can't do it.

22:10.892 --> 22:13.102
Why… Maine…

22:13.978 --> 22:15.188
Why…

22:25.406 --> 22:26.657
David.

22:29.952 --> 22:31.788
This is the end of the line for me.

22:32.955 --> 22:37.627
But not for you.
Fast is what you do, remember?

22:38.711 --> 22:40.129
Keep running.
